  "description": "AWS S3 storage provider for StashPup.\n            Implements IFileStorage for Amazon S3 with pre-signed URLs, server-side encryption, and storage classes.\n            Supports thumbnail caching and metadata storage in S3 object metadata.",
  "id": "StashPup.Storage.S3",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-02-20T16:46:17.903Z",
