  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.1 - S3-Compatible Auth Region Fix\n            - FIX: Set AuthenticationRegion on AmazonS3Config when using custom ServiceUrl\n            - Fixes signing errors with S3-compatible services (Garage, MinIO) that reject us-east-1\n\n            Version 1.0.0 - S3-Compatible Endpoint Support\n            - NEW: ServiceUrl option for custom S3-compatible endpoints (Garage, MinIO, etc.)\n            - NEW: ForcePathStyle option for path-style bucket addressing\n            - ENHANCED: GetPublicUrl() now works with custom endpoints\n\n            Version 0.2.0 - Folder Operations Update\n            - NEW: BulkMoveAsync() - Move multiple files at once\n            - NEW: ListFoldersAsync() - Get list of all unique folders\n            - NEW: DeleteFolderAsync() - Delete folder and all contents\n            - ENHANCED: Better folder filtering in search operations\n            - Improved nested folder navigation support\n            \n            Version 0.1.0 - Initial Release\n            - Complete IFileStorage implementation for AWS S3\n            - Pre-signed URL generation\n            - Server-side encryption (AES-256)\n            - Thumbnail generation and caching in S3",
